insert into public.sections (id, day_id, section_order, title, content, minutes)
select
  'a1e4cd3b-fe3d-40e4-ab5d-3109f0bcea5a'::uuid,
  d.id,
  10,
  $d1ens10title$Swapna Jyothi · Karma and a Changed Home$d1ens10title$,
  $d1ens10json$["Swapna Jyothi of Ganapuram, a village in Bapatla district about four kilometres from the Bay of Bengal, spoke first. She had felt like a frog in a well, far from a teacher she called a guru of the universe, and she had never dreamed she would speak with him. The mind had gone blank. What she had been able to keep was this. As cotton burns when it is held before fire, her karmas had burnt, and she could see it. She had looked at as many as eighty karmas and dissolved them. Meditation alone, she said, is not the whole. A transformation has to come, and that is the main thing. The people in front of her were recognising it more clearly than she was.","At home she and her husband had fought like Tom and Jerry. That had ended. They were living with a real concord. Formerly she heard, what has this meditation achieved, the wrong in you has not gone. Now her husband was telling her that it was time to sit, and to go. She had also begun to see the cause behind a person's suffering, and the cause behind laughter, and to notice how speech can leave the other person happy. Words that wound, spoken for no need, were no longer what she wanted to say. She wants her family to be a help to the universe, and she asks this of Hanuman every day. The mind had grown steady. The old pressure to ask large questions had subsided.","Dr Newton said the account would inspire many. She was not a frog in a well. She had become a whale in the great sea, and they were seeing her as a master. As she spoke, it felt as though Durga Mata herself were standing there. This is the transformation wanted: from a state of many limits to the unlimited. Her question, what can I do for the universe, speaks of the condition of the soul. The lotus has opened. Its fragrance is ready to go to everyone. He thanked her, and her family with her."]$d1ens10json$::jsonb,
