insert into public.sections (id, day_id, section_order, title, content, minutes)
select
  '64ff5cf2-d095-451d-af0c-051021b5cd57'::uuid,
  d.id,
  9,
  $d2ens9title$Krishnakumari · The Terrace Garden$d2ens9title$,
  $d2ens9json$["It was time for friends to share what had been happening in their practice. Krishnakumari was invited to speak. She offered her namaskara. She is from Vizianagaram. Three years earlier, depression had come upon her, and for a year and a half she had been taking medicines. Bhanu garu came to Vizianagaram, and only then did she hear of meditation. She went, she met him, and she told him her difficulty. He spoke with her, and then he said: Amma, the Jnanodayam classes are going on — please watch them.","From that day she watched the classes. She spoke with Bhanu garu, and she spoke with Harika. Harika guided her, led her in the grounding meditation, and showed her how to practise. As she continued, a change arrived slowly. She stopped the medicines. A year and a half has now passed since she laid them down. She is doing her work well. On the terrace they have also made a garden. In the doing of these things, and in the work of the house, a deep change has come in her. She is going on with the sadhana. She had hoped, as well, to come to Quantum Life University, and she had been told that a little more time was still needed, and that for the present these practices were enough. She had raised her hand because she wished to speak with Dr. Newton. As she is now, she is well, and she is happy. She offered her thanks, and her gratitude.","He received the sharing with warmth. Coming out of that depression, he said, has happened through the sadhana, because, seen rightly, this whole of nature is Jagadamba herself. And how near that Mother are you now? You are with the trees. The terrace garden is beautiful — wonderful, full of flowering plants, kept with such care. To sit there in meditation, and to spend time with those flowering plants, is a great and wonderful thing.","In November, Dr. Newton and those with him are themselves coming to Vizianagaram, and to Visakhapatnam. For the friends who are watching, on YouTube as well: from the sixth of November there will be classes in three places — Rajahmundry, Vizag, and Vizianagaram. Krishnakumari said she would certainly meet them there.","Harika added that she had already spoken with him, a day or two before, about Krishnakumari, and that Krishnakumari had told it beautifully. She telephones, and she reports what she has done and the benefit that has come. It is deeply inspiring. If everyone will follow in this way, then what has been learned from the Gurus truly bears fruit. The result certainly comes."]$d2ens9json$::jsonb,
