insert into public.sections (id, day_id, section_order, title, content, minutes)
select
  '16981cd4-0848-47c9-a725-9172179030c3'::uuid,
  d.id,
  10,
  $d2ens10title$Vikram · What the Body Carries$d2ens10title$,
  $d2ens10json$["Vikram then offered his namaskara. He had taken part in the Family Constellation a couple of days before, and Dr. Newton had conducted the constellation. The result had come. The difficulty he had shared there — that process has begun, and very amicably. Things are moving forward. He thanked him for it.","There was something further. The acceptance spoken of in the teaching comes to his mind every day. Why are we here? We are in the midst of some fight. Again and again Dr. Newton says it: what is in the way is the way. When the obstacles seem to increase, when in ordinary life they appear to be growing, when it feels as though a testing is under way, that sentence returns with force. He remembers it, and he acts from it.","One matter he placed before the gathering. For almost eight years there has been a great deal of inflammation in the body, and pain in the shoulder as well. Somewhere in the classes it had been said how a person is likely to feel when responsibility is taken on. What Vikram has come to see is that this may be happening because he has been carrying, beyond measure, the responsibility for other people's emotions. Recently an operation for hemorrhoids had also been suggested. He was on the point of going for it, and he had written to ask whether this was the right time. It would be a laser surgery, not a major one. Should it be done, or should he simply continue, meditating quietly, since changes have already come in his life? He had also been given the chance to speak in Jnanodayam. He thanked Dr. Newton, he thanked Mother, and he thanked Harika. Everything is moving forward, and still the inflammation remains. So something, he feels, is yet to be learned.","Dr. Newton congratulated him. Already those changes are being observed. When the knowledge we receive is implemented, when it is placed in conduct, its fruits arrive, and its results become known. The transmission becomes known inside us.","The body itself is a great indicator. It is always informing us about our progress. Some matters still pending, some issues, some burdens, we go on carrying without even knowing that we carry them. A heaviness is felt. In one region of the body there is a weight. The shoulders are bearing something, and it is something that is not one's own. Vikram himself had named it: I am carrying emotions. Recognise that, and let it go. Whatever we are able to recognise, we become able to release.","Hemorrhoids are of the same order, and so is any physical complaint. Behind it an emotion lies hidden, and that emotion has to be dealt with. It certainly has to be dealt with. A person may go for the laser surgery, and there is also an emotion related to the condition. It is called an identity conflict. At home, many difficulties gather around identity. In hemorrhoids there is blood, and the bleeding continues, and a great deal of blood is lost. So there is a difficulty in the blood relationships. It is also a matter of territory. You are questioning your own identity, and your identity has been questioned. While we live on the physical plane we are meant to stand in our own place. That place has not been given. All of this, once we are seated in meditation, is known from the body with still greater accuracy, very precisely. This is what I have to learn. I am carrying this. In the mind I am carrying this burden — this limiting thought, this limiting belief, this emotion, however many of them there are. I let them go. In the state of knowledge, all of this can be clearly received.","Always, before a decision, the intuition has to be asked. Question yourself. Is this the right way? What should I decide? What is my decision? When any decision is to be taken, the answer comes from one's own Atma, and it comes in a symbolic form. That answer is always the right answer. The answer that rises from within, after one has sat in meditation, arrives in one form or another. Whether it comes as yes or as no, that is the answer to be followed.","It was added that Vikram has been with the Jnanodayam classes and is doing very well, and that the feedback has been very good. The hour had moved a little past seven, and there was still room for one more sharing."]$d2ens10json$::jsonb,
  7
