insert into public.sections (id, day_id, section_order, title, content, minutes)
select
  '897180bc-ef7c-4679-a50b-535f72a275f4'::uuid,
  d.id,
  9,
  $d3ens9title$Devi Samarpan · Nine Rounds of Shreem$d3ens9title$,
  $d3ens9json$["The offering of the day before, Devi Samarpan, was to be done again. The left leg is placed over the right. If that cross is uneasy, a basic posture is enough: the right leg nearer the body, the left a little farther out, or laid on top. On a chair the crossing is the same, left over right. To sit this way is to be tuned, in a high focus, to the Mother. It is a sign. It is also called the Lakshmi mudra.","Close the right nostril. Through the left, draw the breath in nine times, one sip after another, with no exhalation between them. Then a slight pause. While the breath is slowly released, the hands come into namaskara and the head bows. If it can touch the earth, well. If not, the hands touch. The breath is let out completely and held out. This is sharanagati, coming for refuge. While the head is bowed and the breath held out, the seed-syllable Shreem is placed nine times. It is not spoken aloud, and not formed on the lips. Speech uttered outside is vaikhari. On the lips it is madhyama. Thought in the mind is pashyanti. Para is the level of the soul, finer than fine. At that level Shreem simply streams. Then come slowly back to an ordinary upright posture. That is one round.","He led the first three rounds this way. The remaining six, each person was to do alone, silently, the feeling coming from the heart. When the head bows, the ego is brought to an end: a total surrender to the Mother of the world, because this power is the one that takes charge of everything. After the nine rounds, sit quietly, steady, still.","At the feet of Mahadurga, who has charge of the power of will, every resolve is placed. What is ours to do, we do: the resolve, and a little of the action. All the rest she sees to. She is already within as prana, as divine power, as Kundalini. Whatever is most difficult, whatever will not solve, has been set at her feet. Nine times, done rightly, is enough. More is not required. Nine days and nine times are a matching. It is done on the lunar breath, Chandra-svara, because the practice belongs to the Mother and is a going inward. Outward activity belongs to the solar breath, Surya-svara. The steps are logical. There is a science in them, a shastra."]$d3ens9json$::jsonb,
  4
