insert into public.sections (id, day_id, section_order, title, content, minutes)
select
  'a740a80e-5dd9-45c5-a238-fc92dc5a5001'::uuid,
  d.id,
  1,
  $d4ens1title$Opening Meditation · Breath, Crown, and Sankalpa$d4ens1title$,
  $d4ens1json$["Welcome to the 564th day of the Jnanodayam programme. On each of these days we are receiving the knowledge of Devi Navaratri from the founder and chairman of Quantum Life University, Dr. Newton Kondaveti. Today is the fourth day of the observance. As on every morning, the hour begins with meditation. The knowledge comes after the sitting.","Everyone is invited into Anapanasati, attention upon the natural breath. Cross the feet. If you are wearing glasses, set them aside. Let the fingers rest in a simple mudra, and sit in sukhasana, a posture that is easy and steady.","Close the eyes and watch the breath that is already moving. With a slight smile, let these forty minutes be a complete forgetting of the outer world. Travel inward, and do the practice. A collective meditation in the Brahma muhurta, the hour before dawn, is in this Navaratri powerful, special, and fortunate. The power in us has to be known, and the power that is the source of creation. For that the mind has to become empty and still. With full awareness, let the sitting continue.","Give the practice your whole attention. In this moment no other thought matters. The breath itself is the meditation. This awareness is kept for a long stretch of the sitting, about twenty minutes, before the attention is moved.","Then, slowly, bring the attention to the top of the head and observe the Sahasrara, the crown. This energy stands in every one of us as the light of knowledge. Feel it flowing through the whole body, and experience it. From the crown, every organ is being filled.","Round about, the same energy moves still more wonderfully. Everyone in this collective knowing is connected, and the energies together rise as a larger field. Across the earth a sankalpa is taken for the welfare of the world. May the inner knowledge in every person awaken. May compassion, peace, friendship, joy, knowledge of the Self, and knowledge of Brahman awaken in all. The resolve is that the Sahasrara Pyramid will stand behind that sankalpa in a wonderful way.","See your own sankalpa being fulfilled, and the whole earth growing in strength. With trust, release the resolve into the universe. Very soon this Sahasrara Pyramid is to stand before our eyes, and a wonderful meditation is held in it. All of us are coming to know ourselves. On this earth the highest vibrations are moving.","Bring the attention back to the breath for the last two minutes, and then one minute more. The final ten seconds are counted down to zero. Slowly rest both hands over the eyes. With a smile, open them.","Welcome back. The fourth day has arrived. What greater celebration is there than to learn, after the dawn meditation, from a knower of Brahman? With a smile, those on the call turn their cameras on. Brahmarshi Chakravarti Dr. Newton Kondaveti, founder of Quantum Life University, is welcomed in, and the session is placed in his hands."]$d4ens1json$::jsonb,
