insert into public.sections (id, day_id, section_order, title, content, minutes)
select
  'a351f7e4-dc6b-4dd1-a40d-eb615e87d912'::uuid,
  d.id,
  12,
  $d4ens12title$Devi Samarpan · The Song and the Invitations$d4ens12title$,
  $d4ens12json$["Once more, a Devi samarpana, a surrender to Devi Mata, done together and at ease. The mudra is Lakshmi mudra: the left foot, or the left hand, rests on top, because primacy is given to Shakti, and Shakti is to be known first. Close both eyes. Close the right nostril. Through the left nostril take nine inward breaths, one after another, with no exhalation between them. Inhalations only, not one breath in and then out. It is nine days, and so it is nine. He made this plain for anyone newly joined. Then hold, gently.","Remain in namaskara mudra. While the head bows, breathe out slowly and completely, until the head touches the earth, or until the hands touch. That touch is the surrender. We surrender completely to the Mother, to Jagannmata, to Adishakti, to the Mother who is Kundalini. There, hold again, and within, repeat Shrim nine times. It is not pronounced, and it is not said aloud. Shrim is how we refer to Mahashakti, the great power, at the level of vibration: the para level, where sound is supreme and unmanifest, and the pashyanti level, where it is still subtle. Then bring the head slowly back, and return to the ordinary posture at your own pace. The whole sequence is done nine times today.","While the head bows, the ego is renounced and surrendered completely. It is a bow to the Great Mother, the mother of mothers, the original Mother, our Jagannmata, that Parashakti.","He then asked Harika to chant a praise of Devi, whichever she wished. Every day her chant is heard, poetic and beautiful in the voice. Today, too, it was heard. She sang the kriti Śyāmalē Mīnākṣi sundareśa-sākṣi. He thanked her.","Those who had raised a hand, wishing to speak with him, were asked to bring it tomorrow's class. There was laughter, and no difficulty about it: the sharings would be taken tomorrow. He thanked everyone. Tomorrow, Mahishasura would be taken up. The class is held every day at this same hour. Let everyone you know be told that Dr. Newton's classes are going on. The videos are added to the playlist, and they can be shared easily.","There is also an invitation to One Maitriya, the Vanamaitriya gathering. Everyone is welcome. At the Quantum Life University campus, every month, a free programme of two days is held. We meditate together, and we learn. There are groves of energy there, shakti vanas, which Sir and Madam designed with a sankalpa. For each grove it was planned how many plants, which plants, and how many of each, and each grove was connected with an energy. There is the grove of Iccha Shakti, the power of will; of Kriya Shakti, the power of action; of Jnana Shakti, the power of knowledge. There is a Guru grove, a grove of the mother, a grove of the father, a Lakshmi-Narayana grove. There are many such groves, and each has its own meaning. There is a Dakshinamurti grove, a Dhanvantari grove, and the energy proper to each.","The groves can be visited. When we come for this One Maitriya, we also go to Goloka. A Goloka Dhama has been brought and established here by Sir and Madam. All of it can be visited: the plants, the cows, time spent with everyone. There is sharing. There is the company of good people. Everyone is welcome. The details appear on the slide, and from those details one can register. The request is that everyone come. The coming dates are the 24th and the 25th, Saturday and Sunday. One may arrive on Friday evening, before dark. On Saturday morning at five o'clock the programme begins. After lunch on Sunday afternoon, one may leave. It is a very beautiful programme, and it is a programme that everyone ought to experience.","Soulco Transformation has been kept since 2011, and it was not stopped even in the time of COVID. Thousands have attended, and people have received a transformation through it. Once a year it is conducted in Telugu, and once in Hindi. The last day is 24 November, Dr. Newton's birthday. Book now. If the Soul Coach seva or the full participation is not possible, then at least come on that day, the most important day of the year. He was born on Kartika Purnima, and this year 24 November falls on that full moon again. His birthday and the annual day of Quantum Life University are celebrated together, in this field of energy. Let no one miss it. Plan, and come.","Thank you, friends. We meet tomorrow, early in the morning, at five. Thank you. Until then."]$d4ens12json$::jsonb,
