insert into public.sections (id, day_id, section_order, title, content, minutes)
select
  '7a5af691-8ac5-4d14-a6e7-7b2b63269be6'::uuid,
  d.id,
  2,
  $d6ens2title$Parashakti · Shiva Cannot Move Without Her$d6ens2title$,
  $d6ens2json$["There is a power that drives this entire creation, and without that power creation itself would stop. We are speaking of the sadhana by which that power is known in experience. The meditation is necessary. In the Puranas, every single thing that is told is a form of knowledge. Every detail carries a great spiritual science.","In the Soundaryalahari, Adi Shankaracharya says: Shivah shaktya yukto yadi bhavati shaktah prabhavitum. If Shiva is not joined with Shakti, he is not able to act. Without that power even Shiva cannot move, and cannot do anything. This is the Mother of the world. Without her the Trimurtis themselves are not there. Brahma too carries on his head one tiny particle of the dust of her feet, and because of that particle he is able to carry out the whole of creation. The very principle of the Trimurtis rests in her — in this Mother of the world, in this Parashakti, the supreme power.","For this sadhana a verse is given. Na mantram no yantram tad api cha na jane stutim aho. I do not know mantra, Mother. I do not know yantra. I do not know tantra. I know nothing. I do not even know how to speak your name. I do not know invocation, and I do not know meditation, and I do not know how your praise is to be told. How am I to praise you? Even your name will not turn upon my tongue. She has many names. One of them is Tribhuvaneshwari, she who rules the three worlds. I cannot utter even those names. I do not know how to praise you.","I do not know your mudras, your sacred gestures. I do not know how to cry out to you. The one thing I know, O Mother, is following you — and that this following removes sorrow. O Mother of the world, the Mother who is full of compassion and full of mercy already knows us. We do not need to know anything. We have to surrender to her. We have to surrender to that Shakti. What is required is the trust that she will look after us, and the feeling of sharanagati, of having taken refuge.","We do not have to know how to perform worship. We do not have to know how to recite hymns. Take it that we are still at the beginning. Even there, inside meditation itself, this Mother helps us. She is in us as Kundalini Mother, as Kundalini Shakti."]$d6ens2json$::jsonb,
