insert into public.sections (id, day_id, section_order, title, content, minutes)
select
  'ab01ee3c-d3d1-44a9-acfe-6c0f4d124d53'::uuid,
  d.id,
  12,
  $d6ens12title$Anand and Mallareddy · Everything Is Joy$d6ens12title$,
  $d6ens12json$["They had met the day before yesterday, at the great assembly of meditation on ahimsa. Dr. Newton asks that an experience from that day be told to everyone. He and Lakshmi were to give a class there, on non-violence and on a vegetarian world. Harika came, and Pavan came. A car had been brought to take them. The car would not run. Time was short, and in Hyderabad the journey to that place takes forty-five minutes, or an hour. A cab was booked.","Harika asked the natural question. We are going with a good resolve. Why has it happened like this? There is a reason for everything. Such happenings are co-created events, and they are extraordinary. Wait, and see. Simply accept. They got into the cab and went. The driver was under heavy stress. For about ten minutes he was on the phone with someone, speaking in distress. Then the conversation in the car turned to the assembly, and to meditation. It reached his ear. His name was Anand. At once he began to ask questions. My brother-in-law is always talking about meditation. I never really attended to it. I never gave it my mind. He had told me he was coming to Hyderabad, and that he would be at this vegetarian gathering for meditation. You are going to the very place he is going. I will come too.","He was invited to sit in the class for an hour, and he was there while the class was given. Meditation was conducted. When it was over, Anand said: from today I am leaving meat. He had been a meat-eater. What he had seen in the meditation was that animals too are small children. He himself has a child of three. When an animal is killed for food, that animal also loses a family. He declared it. From today, vegetarian food. He had other cab bookings waiting. He did not accept them. He stayed until the programme was finished, and he drove them home.","What astonished them was the way the universe works. It changed the design. They were meant to travel in their own car. Why it failed, they still do not know: the battery was down. For all of this to arrange itself around Anand — what merit he has brought, how fortunate he is, through how many births — the plan was rewritten so that a real transformation could happen in him that day. We call certain events bad. There is no bad. It had to happen in that way. Co-created events are a wonder. This Shakti keeps driving all of it, and none of it should be interpreted through the mind. Seen with the vision of the Atman, it is simply astonishing.","Anand said, that same day, that he would meditate, that from then on his food would be vegetarian, and that he was taking up the practice. All the stress in him had gone — completely. Until then he had been in such a state that life itself felt as though it should end. Financial stress, debts, bank loans, trouble upon trouble. The stress left.","Mallareddy then speaks. From the first day he came, from the Inner Child programme, a transformation has been under way, and it has been wonderful. In the inner life of that discipleship he learned a great deal, and in Family Constellation he learned still more. He used to arrive with a feeling: if I come to you, you will heal me, and in a single day, in a single moment, I must be changed. That feeling was not right. He has come instead to the state in which he himself does the healing. The healing is happening. He understands his own condition. He is meeting every moment with joy, growing each thing joyfully, doing his own healing. Across these nine days it has also become clear how the six inner enemies work, how they are to be gone beyond, and why, in the midst of meditation, they attack even more. Inside the attack itself, the way of facing it, the way growth is asked for, the way healing is done — all of this has become clearer. He offers his gratitude.","Face it with joy. On the very first day it was said: these nine days we are in the state of ananda. Ananda, practised. Practice happens, and joy happens. Practise joy, and there is still more joy. Everything is ananda.","The hour has reached half past seven. What remains can be taken tomorrow, which will be easier for everyone. Early in the morning we meet again, and Surya is asked to share the screen."]$d6ens12json$::jsonb,
