insert into public.sections (id, day_id, section_order, title, content, minutes)
select
  'd58ec6d9-78de-413f-ab3f-c6dce37349f0'::uuid,
  d.id,
  1,
  $d7ens1title$Opening Meditation · Breath and Sahasrara$d7ens1title$,
  $d7ens1json$["Welcome to the 567th day of the Jnanodayam programme. Today is the seventh day of Devi Navaratri. Each day we receive this knowledge from Dr. Newton and put it into practice, and we close with Devi Samarpan, the offering of oneself to the Mother. To be able to receive it, we begin every morning in meditation. Sit comfortably, all of you, in sukhasana, an easy seated posture.","Cross the feet. Let the fingers rest together. Close the eyes, and watch the breath as it moves of itself. With full awareness, keep the attention there. There is a greatness in this breath, and secrets lie hidden in it. The breath is the path by which we reach our true nature and come to know it. It awakens the knowledge already in us. Do not leave it. The mind invents the illusion that other things matter more. Wake from that illusion, and stay with the breath.","For the last ten minutes, remain at the crown. Experience there the light of knowledge, the power of the sahasrara, the thousand-petalled centre. The moment attention rests here, watch that power. Like a stream it moves outward, and in this collective sitting it joins every person who is here. We are drawn together into feeling.","Let us set a sankalpa, a resolve, and see it. On the University campus the Sahasrara is being built. Soon it will be complete, and this power will shape the whole region into knowers of the Self, sounding the start of a new age. All of us are partners in it. We are watching the manifestation with our own eyes. On the 24th of November, 2027, we inaugurate the pyramid together, as a festival.","Seventy-two thousand crystals. The pyramid stands in the lotus of the sahasrara, and around it a globe, the highest of the feminine power and the masculine power. Sacred geometric forms are set inside it. With the five elements the work is being completed, and the landscaping around it is underway. Seeing this, and glad in it, we meditate within it.","Let the experience be whole. From the mind and from the body, release this resolve into the universe. With the breath, at the last moment: five, four, three, two, one, zero. Lay both hands over the eyes for a few moments. With a small smile, open the eyes. Welcome back.","We are on the seventh day of the Navaratri celebration, and everyone is ready to receive the knowledge. Turn the videos on. With a smile, let us welcome the founder and chairman of Quantum Life University, Brahmarshi Chakravarti Dr. Newton Kondaveti. Thank you, Sir. Over to you."]$d7ens1json$::jsonb,
  4
