insert into public.sections (id, day_id, section_order, title, content, minutes)
select
  '5e418206-ba4e-4ea4-a6dc-e8e436c13b1d'::uuid,
  d.id,
  11,
  $d9ens11title$A Practice · Meeting Your Mother$d9ens11title$,
  $d9ens11json$["So let us do a process. It is a small process, but it is very useful. Useful for everyone. Sitting at ease, we are going to do this process in three stages. Sit peacefully in a steady posture. Let us feel that our mother, the mother who gave us birth, is near us. A few feet away from you. Let us feel that she is standing there. Feel that you are in front of her. In her presence, your biological mother, the mother who gave you birth, how are you feeling? What kinds of feeling are arising in you? Do you feel a connection with her, or do you feel far away? Is there a wish to go near Amma, or a wish to move away? Recognise it. We must recognise the feelings inside us.","First, with our mother, this biological mother, there is a connection from the navel. From our very birth. While we were in that mother’s womb, there was a connection at the navel, the connection of the umbilical cord. Through that cord, nourishment came, all the nourishment we needed, from that mother. Do you feel that connection of the cord with this mother? She may be in the physical body, or she may not. She may have left the body. Think once about your connection with your mother.","If it is difficult to see her face clearly, see a beam of light as a symbol, or see her symbolically. Because when we think of our mother, her form appears to us at once. We have a vision of her. Our mother’s form becomes visible to us. Now change the eye with which you are looking, a little. All through childhood there may have been many judgements in us. There may have been some gaps. Our distances may have grown. We may have been looking with the eye that says this mother knows nothing, that there is no knowledge. We may have been making some judgements of our mother. I am a meditator. My mother does not do it properly. My mother does not know. We may have been feeling her to be ignorant. But now, see your mother as a soul.","See the mother who was once a little girl, then a young woman, who in her life faced many limits, many challenges, who received some wounds, who received fears, who also met many difficulties. See her as a soul. In your mother too, she has faced many problems. From her childhood she has been according to the design of her life. She is as she is according to the plan she designed and came with, the plan of the soul. See the great Shakti in her. Now behold the great power that is in that mother. When we see the soul as a soul, we understand.","From your heart, form a connection with your mother. Not only from the navel now. Through your heart, from your heart to Amma’s heart, a ray of light, a fine bond. Feel the two of them forming like a bridge. Some bitter memories of what happened in the past. Some disappointments in you. Your expectations. There may be many expectations of your mother. At this time, seeing completely with the eye of the soul, with the eye of knowledge, keep saying this inwardly to your mother.","Amma, you gave me the highest gift on this earth, the gift called birth. Only through you did I set foot in this world. For that I am grateful to you all my life. Amma, seeing you with a limited eye, I also made some judgements. I looked with the feeling that you know nothing, that you are very small. I felt myself to be much bigger than you. But I am always, before everything, the smaller one. Now behold Amma greatly, as a soul. Shakti, Chaitanya, and knowledge. All three are in that mother.","Without your knowing, you have also taken many weights from your Amma. You took her emotions. You took her fear. You took some of her patterns. Now give them back to Amma herself. Whatever you took from her, whatever you downloaded, the fears, the emotions, her sorrow, none of these are yours. Amma gives back to you the Shakti that belongs to you, and takes back the Shakti that belongs to her. Honour this journey of life, and go forward on your own.","Now, feeling a golden light radiating through you, recognise that this light is melting the anger and the pain between the two of you, and leaving only love, a love without conditions, and freedom. Now see, on the face of that mother, a peaceful smile."]$d9ens11json$::jsonb,
