insert into public.sections (id, day_id, section_order, title, content, minutes)
select
  'a9fcd1cd-e223-46db-a144-95630ce3bbf8'::uuid,
  d.id,
  12,
  $d9ens12title$A Practice · The Mother of the World$d9ens12title$,
  $d9ens12json$["Now, just behind your mother, there is a great empty space, filled with a wonderful, divine light. Behind her are your grandmother, your father’s mother, and so many ancestors. And behind them is the Mother of the world. The Shakti that made this whole creation. The mother of everyone. The mother who created all souls. That very Mother of the world. Durga, Lakshmi, Saraswati. The mother who nourishes every living being in this creation. In her eyes is infinite compassion and love. The gaze falling from her upon you melts even the last pain remaining in your heart.","Go into her lap. Feel that you are going into the lap of the Mother of the world. If she is in a form, see that form. If not, feel her as light. Feel her as a radiance. Feel that the mother, the Mother of the world, has gathered you into her arms with her divine hands. Feel that you are completely safe in her lap.","Now listen to what Amma is saying. The Mother of the world says: O my beloved child, I have always been with you. I was there in the darkness before you were born. Now, in your every breath, I am there. Your birth mother is only a doorway. She is the doorway I chose in order to bring you, my creation, into this physical world. You never have to prove that you are worthy in order to receive my love. You do not have to be perfect in order to receive my protection. Lay at my feet every wound that has touched your inner being. Let me heal you with my love.","Now feel a light, rose-coloured and gold together, flowing like a liquid from the heart of the Mother of the world, straight into your heart. That divine light fills every emptiness, every lack, formed in your mind by human limits. Receive the feeling that this whole creation loves you beyond measure. For a few moments, remain peacefully in that divine light, in Amma’s lap. Notice your heart becoming vast. Observe it. In this stillness, for about two minutes, notice whatever insights are coming to you, whatever rays of knowledge.","Wonderful, friends. Slowly, slowly, come back outside, into the waking state. Our connection with our mother is very important. Whatever distance we have with our mother, that same distance is there too. If we set it here, we are near the Mother there. We go still closer."]$d9ens12json$::jsonb,
