insert into public.sections (id, day_id, section_order, title, content, minutes)
select
  '485b7fe3-0d61-4dfe-a8b4-cfa1779d89ff'::uuid,
  d.id,
  14,
  $d9ens14title$Durga Saptashloki$d9ens14title$,
  $d9ens14json$["Harika Madam then sang the Durga Saptashloki. Shiva asks the Devi, who is easy for the devotee to reach and who accomplishes every work: in this age, tell me carefully the means for the work to be fulfilled. Devi answers: listen, and I will tell you the means by which every wish is fulfilled in this age. Out of my love for you, this praise of the Mother is revealed. The seer of the hymn is Narayana. The metre is anushtubh. The deities are Mahakali, Mahalakshmi, and Mahasaraswati. It is recited for the pleasure of Sri Durga.","The knower’s mind too is drawn by force and bewildered. She, the Devi, the Blessed One, Mahamaya, is the one who does this.","Remembered as Durga, you remove the fear of every living being. Remembered by those who are well, you give a mind, and great good. Who but you takes away poverty, sorrow, and fear? Your heart is always tender for the good of all.","O you who are the auspiciousness of all that is auspicious, the consort of Shiva, who fulfil every aim, the refuge, the three-eyed Gauri, Narayani, salutations to you. O you who are devoted to protecting the afflicted who have come for refuge, who remove the suffering of all, Devi, Narayani, salutations to you. O you who are the form of all, the ruler of all, endowed with every power, protect us from fears, Durga, Devi, salutations to you.","When pleased, you take away every disease. When displeased, you take away every desire that was longed for. Those who have taken refuge in you do not come to ruin. Those who take refuge in you themselves become a refuge. O ruler of all the three worlds, the pacifying of every affliction, and the destruction of what stands against us, must be accomplished by you in this way.","This is the Durga Saptashloki. Thank you, Harika Madam."]$d9ens14json$::jsonb,
  2
