insert into public.sections (id, day_id, section_order, title, content, minutes)
select
  'ca8ff6f4-d70f-4aff-a266-e44e12ef9505'::uuid,
  d.id,
  11,
  $d10ens11title$Putting Spiritual Wisdom into Practice$d10ens11title$,
  $d10ens11json$["Venkata Lakshmi Devi: Namaste, sir, and greetings to all masters. Happy Vijayadashami. We listen to your classes every day; they are wonderful. I have had trouble using Zoom, but I want to share an experience from yesterday. For four days I felt that the Goddess was calling me to visit her temple. I was meditating at home. About fifteen days earlier, during meditation, I had experienced going to Nagaloka, the realm of serpents, and another golden realm. My mind told me not to go to the temple because it was hot and I could go tomorrow. Then I became more aware and recognized that my mind was distracting me. I felt the Mother might be calling me to tell me something, so I went.","When I arrived at the Kanyaka Parameswari temple, I was astonished. It was decorated to resemble Nagaloka, with serpents, anthills, and scenes very similar to what I had seen in meditation. I was amazed and even a little afraid when I remembered how large the serpents had appeared. If I had lost awareness and stayed home, I would not have seen this. I meditated there. People offered their homes for me to conduct classes. I felt as though Hanuman and the Divine Mother were encouraging me to teach. These experiences feel miraculous to me. Quantum Life University offers extraordinary wisdom. You teach what the rishis and yogis practiced and ask us to practice it too. The Durga hymn chanted today was powerful. We had become hesitant about temple worship and Sanskrit chants, but through your teaching we have begun visiting temples, practicing at home, and learning Sanskrit hymns and Vedic teachings again. I am grateful to you, Lakshmi madam, Harika madam, all the masters, and especially the Divine Mother. The Divine Mother and Ardhanarishvara are within us. We need not run outside; we must undertake the inward journey. I have been reading the book Antaryanam since the festival began and enjoy its explanation of breath and the stages of inner travel. I am happy to be your student and to have come to this university. Finding a great teacher who guides us on the right path is my real Vijayadashami.","Teacher: Wonderful, Venkata Lakshmi Devi madam. Thank you very much.","Vijaya: Namaste, sir. Gratitude to you and Lakshmi madam for giving us this wisdom. Earlier I thought these stories were simply stories, but now I understand their subtle meanings. I have recognized and worked on some of the qualities within me. I used to doubt whether I could teach meditation and get people to sit and practice. Today I felt as though people had already come, learned meditation, and that I had taught them. I used to perform worship for nine days every year. This time, when an accident caused an injury to my leg, I understood through meditation that the Mother had protected me from something worse. I felt grateful. Thank you for all the wisdom.","Teacher: Wonderful, Vijaya madam. Happy Vijayadashami. It is amazing that you gained inner courage. Thank you to the entire QLU community, especially Harika, under whose leadership Jnanodayam began, and to Surya, Charan, Anjan, and the other team members.","Host: I would like to introduce our new team member, Divya, who has been helping us for the last ten days.","Divya: Namaste, and happy Dasara to everybody. It is wonderful to be part of the QLU back-end team. QLU is a reason I am here today. There are many people like me who do not yet know why they are here or what their purpose is. I want this wisdom to reach them too. I truly wish for initiatives such as Dhyana Jagat to succeed.","Teacher: Wonderful, Divya. You have been supporting and coordinating things behind the scenes. Jnanodayam is great teamwork, and I appreciate all team members. Is Latha Mahendra madam here? I think she has left; she joins every day. No problem. We will meet again. Thank you, dear friends, and Vijayadashami greetings once again to you and your families."]$d10ens11json$::jsonb,
